      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从母亲那一代起，便始终向前迈步。\n我们铭刻在灵魂里的，正是这份力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cf59fd5892368879195a5a4c6d74f64e8a1797cef0414d679614c08e73a9992",
