    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98ca0a424e504f943ba726cc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那是，只求至高荣光的脚步。\n也是只求胜利的，脚步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19bb149cc197bba4794698a9a0ccb95990b05f160ed403e9792428a23f0932ad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
