      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "与空中救世主相遇，迎来第三个夏天。\n命运第三次，伴随青涩的气息泛起波澜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "029ded5a5eb27fbca5ec3c279f429166167a2c514dedcff49516a566bfa9a315",
