    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd67a456bb54319f94126cf8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想给后冠路线的前辈们，\n送上写着『我很尊敬您！』的巧克力……\n鼓起勇气，亲手送出去！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8578bcf3e2f26327fa8fc890497dbb0bb63cad0f3703c11a6e3b9c21c2c8570",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
