    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf70bf0504cda9baff5aefa5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果如今的我，得到了一些甚至与自身并\n不相称的，正面关注。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ca1d4e6269ed007020af627ee5a7a9793299750aa02669b78d2a2cb8da4482d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
